    "pf-c0d56d3f": {
      "type": "pf-c0d56d3f",
      "settings": {
        "pf_314646eb_value": "UraGuard® is designed with women’s health in mind. Unlike standard incontinence products, Athena features patent-pending UraGuard® technology—a discreet shield that helps reduce exposure to bacteria trapped within the product. By blocking bacteria from reaching the urethral area, UraGuard® adds an extra layer of protection where it matters most.",
        "pf_3857b114_value": "Currently, UraGuard® is available as a shield insert allowing you to add our anti-bacterial protective benefits to any existing incontinence product. However, we understand the need for an all-in-one solution, and we are actively exploring pull-up and tabbed-style options. Stay tuned for updates!",
        "pf_0f44f778_value": "No. UraGuard is a thin barrier shield — not an additional absorbency layer. Moisture passes through into your incontinence product as normal. The difference is that there is now a physical barrier between that product and your skin, blocking bacterial contact at the urethral area.",
        "pf_2dd7d49e_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(25, 52, 69);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 52, 69);\"><b>Most Incontinence Products Prevent Leaks,&nbsp;<br><span style=\"color: rgb(42, 125, 150);\">But Not Bacteria Exposure &amp; Moisture.</span></b></span><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 52, 69);\"></span>",
        "pf_592210b3_value": "Replace UraGuard®&nbsp;whenever you change your incontinence product. Each shield is designed for single-session use. Lab testing confirms it maintains its protective barrier for 8+ hours, so for most women this means two to four shields per day depending on your routine.",
        "pf_9e89edd1_value": "<strong></strong>UraGuard® is the only daily shield built to address bacterial contact from incontinence products.&nbsp;<br><br><span style=\"color: rgb(42, 125, 150);\">If you are not satisfied with the product, we offer an exchange or refund. No hassle.</span>",
        "pf_35e0730a_value": "You can buy UraGuard as a one-time purchase or subscribe to save. If you subscribe: billing is monthly, you can cancel before your next charge with no penalty, and there are no hidden fees. All terms are shown clearly at checkout before you confirm.",
        "pf_f9d620ed_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(25, 52, 69);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 52, 69);\"><b>Try It For 30 Days.<br><span style=\"color: rgb(42, 125, 150);\">On Us, If It Does Not Work.</span></b></span><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 52, 69);\"></span>",
        "pf_ab5b4b45_value": "UraGuard® is designed to stay in place throughout the day. Its thin, flexible, contoured construction moves with your body. It is skin-safe and discreet. In fact, most users report forgetting it is there within the first week of use.",
        "pf_4051a4fb_value": "UraGuard® is proudly manufactured in the USA. We are committed to high-quality manufacturing standards to ensure our products meet the needs of women seeking comfort, protection, and urinary health support.",
        "pf_9054bd98_value": "UraGuard works with an existing incontinence product. There is nothing new to learn,&nbsp;just an extra layer of protection placed exactly where bacteria are most likely to cause harm.",
        "pf_e971596a_value": "All incontinence products<b> trap moisture </b>—&nbsp;creating a breeding ground for <b>bacteria</b>. The longer it's worn, the higher the <b>risk of&nbsp;infection and UTIs</b>.&nbsp;",
        "pf_bbae8455_value": "UraGuard® sits between the <b>urethra </b>and the <b>incontinence product</b> — adding a <b>physical barrier </b>that helps keep bacteria and moisture away from the skin.",
        "pf_914cfd67_value": "Standard incontinence pads weren't designed to block bacteria. UraGuard® adds a lab-tested liner inside what she already wears — no routine changes needed.",
        "pf_3dfc3877_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(26, 74, 90);\"><b>Mom deserves <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 127, 153);\">protection from UTIs,</span> not just leaks.</b></span>",
        "pf_abe24134_value": "Ensure the <b>blue rectangle is facing up</b> and is pointing to you. <b>Place the shield </b>directly where urine exits the body.",
        "pf_26538e79_value": "<b style=\"\"><font color=\"#193445\">Four Steps to Daily Protection.</font></b><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 52, 69);\"></span>",
        "pf_1038f655_value": "<em>“It has a great design. Very soft, easy to put on, and it stays on. Would definitely recommend this product.”</em>",
        "pf_9c943181_value": "<em>\"It helps keep moisture away and prevents bacteria from forming. I do have that peace of mind when using it.”</em>",
        "pf_e472637a_value": "<em>\"My mom found them comfortable and&nbsp; secure, discreet...very easy to use. And I would recommend them.</em>",
        "pf_4925d734_value": "<em>“I believe this is going to be a good fit with my mom to decrease the chance of her getting another UTI”</em>",
        "pf_233bdad7_value": "✔&nbsp;Free Shipping on 60 &amp; 90 Packs<br>✔ 30-day Money-Back Guarantee<br>",
        "pf_a625b672_value": "<b>Dispose of the used liner</b> and replace it with a fresh one when needed.",
        "pf_b8697130_label": "<strong>Is UraGuard® available as a pull-up or tabbed diaper?</strong>",
        "pf_d42fe225_value": "Take your shield and <b>remove the adhesive strip</b> on the back.",
